<h1>Support</h1>

<p>FlatSixDynamics is built by a small team of highly trained experts. There is no support desk, no ticketing system, no chat widget. There is one inbox, which is read.</p>

<p>If something is wrong &mdash; a crash, a wrong number on the cockpit overlay, a translation that reads strangely, a setting that won't stick &mdash; please write. We answer in English. We answer within a few days.</p>

<p><a href="mailto:{{ site.contactEmail }}">{{ site.contactEmail }}</a></p>

<h2>Reporting a problem usefully</h2>

<p>If you can include the following, the fix takes hours instead of days:</p>

<ul>
    <li>iPhone model and iOS version</li>
    <li>App version (visible at the bottom of the in-app Help sheet)</li>
    <li>What you were doing when it happened &mdash; the slider speed, whether the heatmap or grid overlay was on, whether onboarding had been shown</li>
    <li>A screenshot, if the problem is visual</li>
</ul>

<p>The crash-report opt-in inside iOS's standard diagnostics dialog already covers crashes silently; we receive an anonymous symbolicated stack trace from Apple if you have it enabled. For anything that is not a crash, the inbox is the right place.</p>
